diff --git a/docs/run/http.md b/docs/run/http.md
index a57a8db..73be790 100644
--- a/docs/run/http.md
+++ b/docs/run/http.md
@@ -258,3 +258,15 @@ $transport = new StreamableHttpTransport(
     middleware: [new AuthMiddleware($responseFactory)],
 );
 ```
+
+An empty `middleware: []` logs a warning on every request, since it usually means the defaults were
+dropped by accident. If your framework already handles CORS and host validation in its own HTTP layer,
+pass `warnOnEmptyMiddleware: false` to say the empty list is deliberate:
+
+```php
+$transport = new StreamableHttpTransport(
+    $request,
+    middleware: [],
+    warnOnEmptyMiddleware: false,
+);
+```
